    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_g_c_strategy" kindref="compound">GCStrategy</ref> describes a garbage collector algorithm&apos;s code generation requirements, and provides overridable hooks for those needs which cannot be abstractly described. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_g_c_strategy" kindref="compound">GCStrategy</ref> objects must be looked up through the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref>. The objects themselves are owned by the Context and must be immutable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
